name": "5.png", "id": "1137691651625905", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491831569_1137691654959238_3743815840852897955_n.png?_nc_cat=105&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Rnu6urwX4PcQ7kNvwEmUf9K&_nc_oc=AdrT0-xLaYhKg9K5jDLEbgHy3C9qqIlzfqA_to8IE0U1qy341cGsSiHrF4VKx1CqvQg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTWQ0xy8MGK6-mkt8FBXqcECmUsYlItiOp3MdxZt1uL9A&oe=6AFC71C3"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "OverLoad", "keywords": [], "long_description": " # Join the fight\n                                                           \n\n In **Overload** \u2014 a fast-paced multiplayer shooter where you can battle solo or team up with friends. Choose from **10+ powerful weapons** , customize your look with tons of cosmetics, and build your squad by adding friends to your in-game list.\n\n\n\n# Overload currently features 3 thrilling modes:\n\n- **Duels** \u2013 Prove your skills in 1v1 showdowns\n\n- **Team Deathmatch** \u2013 Work together and dominate as a squad\n\n- **Deathmatch** \u2013 Every player for themselves, no mercy\n\n{1461129098441055}\n\n# What to Expect\n\n**Constant updates**: new maps, new guns, and fresh cosmetics\n\n**Daily**, **weekly**, **and monthly quests** to keep the action rewarding\n\n**Party up** and jump straight into the action with friends\n\n{798544342560458}", "short_description": " In **Overload** \u2014 a fast-paced multiplayer shooter where you can battle solo or team up with friends. Choose from **10+ powerful weapons** , customize your look with tons of cosmetics, and build your squad by adding friends to your in-game list."}]}, "developer_name": "5Vstudios", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://5vstudios.com/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "5Vstudios", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://5vstudios.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR